{"id":"094d1f8fab5c0d3a","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Analytic Set Code","display":"df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code — ZFC Topo11 Analytic Set Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code — ZFC Topo11 Analytic Set Code","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code — ZFC Topo11 Analytic Set Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7af3117cdc5ab072\" href=\"?note=7af3117cdc5ab072\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation\">58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b77792f5f68e33d6\" href=\"?note=b77792f5f68e33d6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map\">58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology\">58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,\\tau,C,Y,\\sigma,f\">\\(A,X,\\tau,C,Y,\\sigma,f\\)</span> (topology parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\)</span> (typed topological predicates)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists P_X,d_X,D_X,Y,\\sigma,P_Y,d_Y,D_Y,\\tau_C,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_X,X,\\tau,d_X,D_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_Y,Y,\\sigma,d_Y,D_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\sigma,C)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_C,C,Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,C,\\tau_C,X,\\tau)\\land A=f[C]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists P_X,d_X,D_X,Y,\\sigma,P_Y,d_Y,D_Y,\\tau_C,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_X,X,\\tau,d_X,D_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_Y,Y,\\sigma,d_Y,D_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\sigma,C)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_C,C,Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,C,\\tau_C,X,\\tau)\\land A=f[C]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The code includes explicit Polish presentations of source and target, a closed source subset with its subspace topology, and a typed continuous surjection onto <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"7af3117cdc5ab072","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"b77792f5f68e33d6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo10-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology","status":"resolved","id":"694a41b0cb75249b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"A,X,\\tau,C,Y,\\sigma,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11AnalyticSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,C)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists P_X,d_X,D_X,Y,\\sigma,P_Y,d_Y,D_Y,\\tau_C,f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_X,X,\\tau,d_X,D_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P_Y,Y,\\sigma,d_Y,D_Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\sigma,C)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_C,C,Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ContinuousMap}_S(f,C,\\tau_C,X,\\tau)\\land A=f[C]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3672","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-analytic-set-code]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["7af3117cdc5ab072","b77792f5f68e33d6","4dc8b2d2e69010a2","694a41b0cb75249b"]}